block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"至灵帝时，大抄略幽、并二州；缘边诸郡，无岁不被其毒","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":478,"end":503,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e4c101aa0f5ed838d26d","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"施法禁，〔平〕曲直，莫敢犯者：遂推以为大人","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":154,"end":175,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e619d172c732994d4949","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"妻乃语家，令收养焉，号‘檀石槐’","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":80,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-f57cd43abca06ea7253c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"兵马甚盛，南抄汉边，北拒丁令，东却夫余，西击乌孙；尽据匈奴故地，东西万（二）〔四〕千余里，南北七千余里","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":211,"end":262,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
